00:12:34,111 --> 00:12:35,111
Screw that.

300
00:12:37,111 --> 00:12:38,111
Boss, wait!

301
00:12:38,111 --> 00:12:39,111
You gotta take it easy!

302
00:12:40,111 --> 00:12:41,111
Hey, rubber boy!

303
00:12:41,111 --> 00:12:44,111
I was pretty attached to that wind streak of mine!

304
00:12:44,111 --> 00:12:46,111
I'm not pleased about you ruining it!

305
00:12:46,111 --> 00:12:47,111
