409
00:15:36,111 --> 00:15:40,111
Hey, cheers for the new Straw Hat Pirates!

410
00:15:40,111 --> 00:15:42,111
I hate to say this, but no matter how you look at it,

411
00:15:42,111 --> 00:15:44,111
