422
00:16:02,111 --> 00:16:04,111
Yeah, fat chance!

423
00:16:06,111 --> 00:16:07,111
Fat chance.

424
00:16:07,111 --> 00:16:08,111
Boop, boop, boop, boop, boop, boop!

425
00:16:08,111 --> 00:16:09,111
Ah!

426
00:16:09,111 --> 00:16:10,111
Then go, you jerks!

427
00:16:10,111 --> 00:16:11,111
Who needs you?

428
00:16:11,111 --> 00:16:13,111
So long, X-Boss!

429
00:16:13,111 --> 00:16:15,111
Don't catch a cold!

430
00:16:15,111 --> 00:16:17,111
Wash your teeth twice a day!

431
00:16:17,111 --> 00:16:18,111
Take a bath!

432
00:16:18,111 --> 00:16:20,111
Hey, rubber boy!

433
00:16:20,111 --> 00:16:21,111
Hm?

434
00:16:21,111 --> 00:16:23,111
I'll make you pay for this!

435
00:16:23,111 --> 00:16:25,111
Just wait!

436
00:16:25,111 --> 00:16:28,111
That's supposed to be a joke, right?

437
00:16:28,111 --> 00:16:29,111
Okay!

438
00:16:29,111 --> 00:16:30,111
Listen, men!

439
00:16:30,111 --> 00:16:32,111
It's time for your first job as members

440
00:16:32,111 --> 00:16:34,111
of the new Straw Hat Pirate Crew!

441
00:16:34,111 --> 00:16:36,111
Are you guys ready?

442
00:16:36,111 --> 00:16:37,111
Yeah!

443
00:16:37,111 --> 00:16:38,111
You can count on us!

444
00:16:38,111 --> 00:16:39,111
Yeah, rubber boss!

445
00:16:39,111 --> 00:16:41,111
You're all dismissed!

446
00:16:41,111 --> 00:16:43,111
You mean you're kicking us off?

447
00:16:43,111 --> 00:16:45,111
Yep, you got it.

448
00:16:45,111 --> 00:16:46,111
Captain's orders are absolute,

449
00:16:46,111 --> 00:16:48,111
so I don't want to hear anyone complaining.

450
00:16:48,111 --> 00:16:50,111
I don't care if you join your own crews again

451
00:16:50,111 --> 00:16:52,111
or if you go back to Splithead,

452
00:16:52,111 --> 00:16:53,111
but whatever you do,

453
00:16:53,111 --> 00:16:54,111
you can't stay with us.

454
00:16:54,111 --> 00:16:55,111
So long!

455
00:16:55,111 --> 00:16:56,111
Come back!

456
00:16:56,111 --> 00:16:57,111
X-Boss!

457
00:16:57,111 --> 00:16:58,111
We miss you!

458
00:16:58,111 --> 00:17:00,111
We belong with the Foxy Pirates after all!

459
00:17:00,111 --> 00:17:01,111
Well, that worked out nicely.

460
00:17:01,111 --> 00:17:02,111
Hee-hee!

461
00:17:02,111 --> 00:17:03,111
Hee-hee!

462
00:17:03,111 --> 00:17:04,111
Hee-hee!

463
00:17:04,111 --> 00:17:05,111
That's right, Shelly.

464
00:17:05,111 --> 00:17:07,111
It's finally over.

465
00:17:07,111 --> 00:17:08,111
Don't be afraid, girl.

466
00:17:08,111 --> 00:17:10,111
The bad guys are gone.

467
